], "id": "2121588965954486570", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u65e5\u6cbc\u8aed\u53f2\u306e\u300cAI\u6d3b\u7528\u5165\u9580\u587e\u300d\n\u88cf\u3067\u4f5c\u696d\u3057\u3066\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u30fc\u3092\u52a9\u3051\u308b\u65b0AI\u30a8\u30fc\u30b8\u30a7\u30f3\u30c8\u300cMuse\u300d\u3001\u30d5\u30a3\u30c3\u30c8\u30cd\u30b9\u7fd2\u6163\u306b\u3082\u6709\u52b9\u304b\u3082\nhttps://t.co/CnXsRpbsKY\n(AI Watch)\n#Meta\n#Muse \uff21\uff29\u30a8\u30fc\u30b8\u30a7\u30f3\u30c8\n\u8208\u5473\u95a2\u5fc3 \u60c5\u5831 \u84c4\u7a4d\n#AI\n#\u30db\u30ea\u30a8\u30e2\u30f3\uff21\uff29\u5b66\u6821 #\u30af\u30ea\u30a8\u30a4\u30bf\u30fc\u30ba\u30a2\u30ab\u30c7\u30df\u30fc\n2026/10/30", "url": "https://x.com/horiemonAIcaca/status/2121588965954486570"}, {"author_id": "1516209243350781958", "created_at": "2026-11-14T12:57:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121588447366271080"], "id": "2121588447366271080", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2849898913", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121393998501916823", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@_amancalledaman @bruno_munhoz @finkd @alexandr_wang @Meta @Muse Internally hopefully support jumps on my support ticket about my @Muse getting a video generation block on my account. Says it's because of my region.... I'm American though \ud83d\ude12", "url": "https://x.com/roughneckactual/status/2121588447366271080"}, {"author_id": "75926103", "created_at": "2026-11-14T12:44:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121585058360250787"], "id": "2121585058360250787", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta\u300cMuse\u300d\u307e\u3060\u59cb\u3081\u3066\u306a\u3044\u4eba\u3044\u305f\u3089\u3001\u62db\u5f85\