67Meta Muse\u3092\u59cb\u3081\u305f\u3044\u65b9\u3078\ud83d\udcbb\u3011\n\nChrome\u304b\u3089\u4f7f\u3046Web\u7248\u306e\u59cb\u3081\u65b9\u30fb\u521d\u671f\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u307e\u3057\u305f\ud83d\udcdd", "url": "https://x.com/2abundant2free/status/2121572286025392471"}, {"author_id": "842341764241412096", "created_at": "2026-11-14T11:46:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121570413386121366"], "id": "2121570413386121366", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u3010Meta Muse \u524d\u7de8\u3011AI\u6642\u4ee3\u306b\u305d\u3082\u305d\u3082\u30e1\u30fc\u30eb\u3044\u308b\uff1f\u4f7f\u308f\u306a\u3044\u6d3e\u306e\u671d\u306e\u6301\u8ad6 ep3304 https://t.co/hkoFnpINhX @YouTube\u3088\u308a", "url": "https://x.com/hiroyuki12/status/2121570413386121366"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121565883604647936"]}, "author_id": "1921866319344914433", "created_at": "2026-11-14T11:31:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121566599316647983"], "id": "2121566599316647983", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 201, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "OpenAI launched ChatGPT Wallet, so its agents can now pay for things. \n\nYou approve every purchase with Face ID, and the card networks issue a one-time token so the agent never sees your card. $V, $MA and $AXP are all in. \n\nThey're definitely targeting $META Muse. https://t.co/GP6xfnZnHF", "url": "https://x.com/dmeinvestor/status/2121566599316647983"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121565439931088897"]}, "author_id": "1443195228165447680", "created_at": "2026-11-14T11:26:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121565457039655205"], "id": "2121565457039655205", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI launches ChatGPT Wallet for Dots agents\n\nOpenAI launched ChatGPT Wallet on November 13 2026 for ChatGPT Pro subscribers in the US.\n\nUsers must be 18 or older with a US billing address and an eligible US issued American Express Chase Mastercard or Visa card.\n\nDots agents https://t.co/XHNDd5SDIV", "url": "https://x.com/ApollonVisual/status/2121565457039655205"}, {"author_id": "1937114439008071680", "created_at": "2026-11-14T11:22:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121564350528033162"], "id": "2121564350528033162", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1828756162872823808", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121563474262425882", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@TheDoraaaaaaaa Bro meta muse is a good product \ud83d\ude05", "url": "https://x.com/CodeWithSravya/status/2121564350528033162"}, {"author_id": "940583112567902211", "created_at": "2026-11-14T11:22:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121564298581578220"], "id": "2121564298581578220", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tuya lance Tuya Cloud Devices, une extension open source qui permet \u00e0 l'agent IA Meta Muse de piloter en langage naturel des objets de plus de 3 000 cat\u00e9gories. Serrures et vid\u00e9o en direct restent exclues ; pas encore de date pour l'Europe.\n\nhttps://t.co/pV1EiQXw38", "url": "https://x.com/actu_iot/status/2121564298581578220"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121562436356501504"]}, "author_id": "1470238682", "created_at": "2026-11-14T11:15:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121562564135997566"], "id": "2121562564135997566", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 340, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta found a new reason to charge $20 a month: bad customer service.\n\nMeta Muse 